cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the whatrobot taxonomy, please cite it as below. A DOI for each release is minted on Zenodo."
title: "whatrobot taxonomy: an open MECE taxonomy of robots and robot components"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Cowling
    given-names: Simon
    affiliation: fysical.ai
  - name: fysical.ai
version: "2026-01"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fysical-ai/whatrobot-taxonomy"
url: "https://whatro.bot"
abstract: >-
  A classification of robots by body plan and of robot components by component type, in which every
  item sits in exactly one leaf decided from hardware facts, with typed attributes for segment,
  application, autonomy, specifications and compatibility. Includes mappings to ISO 8373:2021, the IFR
  World Robotics classifications, and the Google and Shopify product taxonomies, and localisations in
  English and Simplified Chinese.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - taxonomy
  - classification
  - humanoid robots
  - product taxonomy
